Subject: [PATCH 29/34] configs: add imx8mp basic cells for FreeRTOS and Zephyr

Signed-off-by: Hou Zhiqiang <Zhiqiang.Hou@nxp.com>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 configs/arm64/imx8mp-hmc-freertos.c | 52 ++++++++++++++++++
 configs/arm64/imx8mp-hmc-rtos.h     | 81 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 configs/arm64/imx8mp-hmc-zephyr.c   | 52 ++++++++++++++++++
